SUMMARY:Qi Gong (Mindful Movement) at Barbieri Park in Healdsburg
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T110000
UID:261009_QqC1vXqQkaEFaGUZOMC8g
DESCRIPTION:Marianne Benforado\, Licensed Acupuncturist and Certified Qi G
 ong Teacher will offer a mindful movement class at Barbieri Park in Healds
 burg on Saturday\, October 10 and Saturday\, October 24\, from 10–11 am.
  $20 drop in. Come to either or both!\n\nThere’s something really specia
 l about practicing Qi Gong outside. It's a good reminder that we’re part
  of Nature. We move with the trees\, feel our feet on the grass\, breathe 
 the fresh air\, listen to the birdies and take in the long view toward the
  hills and vineyards. All senses engaged!\n\nIt’s a beautiful way to get
  out of our heads for awhile. No experience is needed. Really! Just show u
 p and mirror the movements. Come a few minutes early to pay and get regist
 ered.
LOCATION:Barbieri Park
URL:https://feelbetteracu.com/events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://thelettinggoartexperience.com/sessions/step-into-wonder-oct-10-deep-dive/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Deep Dive Wonder Experience - Letting Go Art Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
UID:261004xG6LZg0-pk2gqchKXlUKFg
DESCRIPTION:In this intimate three-hour workshop\, you’ll slow down\, re
 connect with yourself\, and experience The Letting Go Art Experience as a 
 guided creative journey.\n\nThrough gentle meditation or breathwork\, mean
 ingful conversation\, expressive art exercises\, and reflective prompts\, 
 you’ll move beyond creating artwork and begin exploring what your creati
 vity has to teach you.\n\nThis isn’t about learning artistic techniques.
 \n\nIt’s about discovering what happens when you stop trying to make som
 ething perfect and start listening to your own intuition instead.\n\nEvery
  Deep Dive follows a thoughtfully designed beginning\, middle\, and end\, 
 creating space for insight\, self-expression\, laughter\, and meaningful c
 onnection.\n\nLeave feeling lighter\, more inspired\, and more connected
 —to yourself and to others.\n\n$45 • Ages 18\\+ Limited to 15 particip
 ants
LOCATION:Mare Island Art Studios
URL:https://thelettinggoartexperience.com/sessions/step-into-wonder-oct-10
 -deep-dive/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
