SUMMARY:Laguna Open House & California Native Plant Sale
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
UID:260711akHd_Cw97UK9-7x_m9WqqA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive\, free autumn celebration at the Laguna 
 Environmental Center. Take a guided walk through our native plant demonstr
 ation garden at 11:00am or 12:00pm\, explore the beautiful grounds\, and v
 isit Spirit of My Homeland\, a new exhibit in Heron Hall featuring the wo
 rk of artist Gloria Armstrong. The exhibit celebrates cultural connection\
 , family\, and place through artwork rooted in lived experience and local 
 landscapes.\n\nAs part of the day’s festivities\, the Milo Baker Chapte
 r of the California Native Plant Society will host their annual native pla
 nt sale in our shared nursery. It’s the perfect time to add habitat-frie
 ndly plants to your garden and learn more about California native plants.\
 n\nAdditional community partners and organizations will be joining us wit
 h resources\, activities\, and opportunities to connect with local conserv
 ation efforts. More details coming soon!\n\nWe’re proud to offer this ev
 ent as a celebration of art\, nature\, and community. Thank you for joinin
 g us to explore the native landscape\, support local conservation\, and co
 nnect with the Laguna de Santa Rosa.
LOCATION:Laguna Environmental Center
URL:https://2026LagunaOpenHouse.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
