SUMMARY:Votes\, Voice and Victory:115th Anniversary of California Women's 
 Suffrage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T140000
UID:260928ApbIY1BFz0S75jQFCbQ7EQ
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun and inspiring day celebrating the 115t
 h anniversary of California Women's Suffrage!\n\nCheck out informational t
 ables hosted by Sonoma State University Library\, Sonoma County Public Lib
 rary\, National Women’s History Alliance\, Sonoma County Historical Soci
 ety\, Saturday Afternoon Club\, Sonoma Valley Historical Society and the L
 eague of Women Voters for Sonoma County.\n\nHear from our guest speaker\,
  Molly Murphy MacGregor\, Co-Founder of the National Women’s History As
 sociation \\(NWHA\\)\, and watch the fascinating video by Wild West Women 
 Inc. called "California Women Win the Vote".\n\nIt’s a great chance to 
 learn\, celebrate\, and connect with the history of women’s rights in Ca
 lifornia. See you there!\n\nFree parking is available in the parking lot b
 ehind the barracks.\n\nCalifornia State Parks supports equal access. Visit
 ors with disabilities who need assistance\, email Deborah Lee with the ta
 gline equal access deborah.lee@parks.ca.gov.
LOCATION:Sonoma State Historic Park - Sonoma Barracks
URL:https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScG0wwvOESRoow3Z29WARahlPjwUm
 ZpUnz3bctY1RZgIAdDOw/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=116177566890910860742
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
