BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.nicasiovalleypumpkinpatch.net"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:The Social Contractors Rock The Nicasio Valley Pumpkin Patch!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T160000
UID:261009zLWdohVVjUeKHlVv64K7CA
DESCRIPTION:Rock with us in beautiful Nicasio valley from noon-4 pm at the
  Nicasio Valley Pumpkin Patch!\n\nWe'll be performing our upbeat blend of 
 original rock plus classic hits you know and love from the 60s-80s (Beatle
 s\, Hendrix\, CCR\, Doors\, Pink Floyd\, Tom Petty\, Police\, Men At Work\
 , U2\, Gerry Rafferty\, Tears for Fears\, Steve Miller\, Stevie Wonder\, S
 teely Dan\, and more!). \n\nWe'll be in full four piece form featuring ba
 nd founder and songwriter Jason E Davies on guitar and vocals\, Travis Tha
 yer on keys\, sax\, and vocals\, Rob Neidel on bass and vocals\, and Chris
  Oatman on drums! Whether you enjoy searing guitar and sax solos\, dynamic
  and danceable rhythms\, or captivating songs\, you're going to love it!\n
 \nThe Nicasio Pumpkin Patch will be featuring a selection of great food an
 d beverages – and of course PUMPKINS! All in a beautiful setting with wh
 at should be perfect weather. Hope to see you there!
LOCATION:Nicasio Valley Pumpkin Patch
URL:https://www.nicasiovalleypumpkinpatch.net
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
