BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://empresstheatre.org/event/4th-space-by-idu-house/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:4th Space by Idu House
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T230000
UID:261005GqdtQllJFUu0--x7J1o9ng
DESCRIPTION:4th Space is a live music and community experience built aroun
 d a simple belief: when artists are given a real stage\, a real room\, and
  a community that actually shows up\, something different happens. Tonight
  is what that looks like.\n\nThe night unfolds in three arcs: Identity\, E
 xpression\, and Release. The experience starts at 6:00 PM before you ever 
 reach your seat. The lobby will be activated with an ambient DJ set\, drin
 ks\, and soft visuals designed to let you settle in and connect before the
  curtain opens.\n\n🎙️ The Lineup\n\nE’mani Aurielle — Live \\(90'
 s/00's R&B & Soul\\)\n\nTyler-Lauren — Live \\(90s R&B\, soul\, and jazz
  fusion\\)\n\nTravie Bobbito — DJ Set \\(Love Supreme SF founder\\)\n\n
 🕒 Run of Show\n\n6:00 PM — Doors & Activated Lobby\n\n7:00 PM — In-
 Theater Opening\n\n7:45 PM — Live Performances Begin\n\nBetween sets\, s
 hort intermissions give you time to breathe\, visit the bar\, and let the 
 night build. Expect live vocals in a room whose acoustics were built for e
 xactly this.\n\nBe in the room. One night only. \\*Tip: Arrive early to ca
 tch the lobby experience before the theater portion begins.
LOCATION:Empress Theatre
URL:https://empresstheatre.org/event/4th-space-by-idu-house/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
