 ere as you learn to create your own masterpiece. This beginner-friendly c
 lass is designed to open up your imagination by learning basic techniques
  when using crepe paper as the flower composition. All necessary supplies
  and tools will be provided. Just bring your inspired-artful love of flow
 ers. Participants will take home their finished bouquets.\n\nTo register:
  please email mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gma
 il.com Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com
