UID:2608302E5vCZgwiUSW3L2J9QBA4A
DESCRIPTION:Alternative Rock Group Magenta Ray to Perform Live at The Gard
 en in Napa\n\nNAPA\, Calif.\, October 10\, 2026 \n\nAlternative rock and 
 dark wave band Magenta Ray will perform live at The Garden in Napa on Satu
 rday\, Oct. 10\, 2026\, at 8 p.m.\n\nFeaturing founding members Lisa Hart 
 on lead vocals and Mark Larson on guitar and synths\, the band delivers a 
 dynamic sound ranging from cinematic and atmospheric dark wave arrangement
 s to high-energy rock. Joining them on stage are Joe Shotwell on drums\, A
 lan Parks on electric and upright bass\, and Frank Acosta on guitar and vi
 olin.\n\nThe band will showcase a full set of original music\, including t
 heir recent single "A Kiss Like This."\n\nEvent Details:\n\nWhat: Magenta 
 Ray Live Performance\n\nWhen: Saturday\, Oct. 10\, 2026 at 8 p.m.\n\nWhere
 : The Garden\, 1500 1st St.\, Napa\, Calif. 94559\n\nTickets & Admission: 
 Free admission
LOCATION:The Garden
URL:https://tannerybendbeerworks.com
