X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Culinary Garden Cooking Classes at Quivira Vineyards
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T000000
UID:261009MnZ1c_WA9UK6097Sx_-PKQ
DESCRIPTION:Join an immersive\, hands-on culinary series at Quivira Vineya
 rds\, offered June 7-November 15 from 11 AM - 2 PM. Led by Estate Chef Jul
 ia\, guests begin in the organic estate garden harvesting seasonal ingredi
 ents before moving to the open-air kitchen to prepare a garden-inspired\, 
 multi-course meal. This interactive experience highlights the connection b
 etween garden\, vineyard\, and kitchen\, while teaching practical culinary
  techniques. The evening concludes with a shared meal paired with Quivira 
 wines in a beautiful estate setting. Each date features a different focus\
 , including handmade pasta\, masa and tacos\, stuffed pasta\, global dumpl
 ings\, and seasonal pie baking. Space is limited for these unique seasonal
  classes.
LOCATION:Quivira Vineyards and Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/culinary-garden-cooking-classes-at-quivir
 a-vineyards/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
