DESCRIPTION:We’re heading out to Mare Island on Sunday 10-11. As usual w
 e will meet at The Exchange Vallejo at 10:00 am and we will roll out at 10
 :15. We’re going to head up Marin to City Park and then strait down to t
 he island. We will head out to the Mare Island Preserve and those who want
  to climb the hill can and those who want to chill can at the benches. Aft
 er our time at the preserve we will wiggle through the island and then hea
 d back downtown via the waterfront. As usual we will stay as a group and r
 ide at “Party Pace” Let’s go ride bikes!
LOCATION:The Exchange
