X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/see-art-in-action-at-t-barny-s-studio-tours/19907916/2026-10-11T10"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:See 'ART IN ACTION' at  T Barny's STUDIO TOURS
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T170000
UID:260915G9PRxMXk-kGaKVZE2sRavQ
DESCRIPTION:Sculptor T Barny invites visitors into his Alexander Valley St
 udio.\n\nFor two weekends \, October 10–11 & 17–18\, 2026\, visitors c
 an explore Barny’s working studio\, see sculptures in progress and finis
 hed works\, and discover how a block of stone becomes sculpture.\n\nAt 11 
 AM and 3 PM each day\, Barny will lead a special Studio Tour & Demonstrati
 on\, sharing the tools and techniques behind his direct-carving process. V
 isitors can see how he carves and polishes stone\, learn about the tools o
 f the trade\, and even pick up a hammer and chisel and try carving marble 
 themselves.\n\nWith more than 45 years as a sculptor\, Barny has created o
 ver 1\,000 sculptures\, working with more than 200 types of stone from aro
 und the world.\n\nCome meet the artist\, explore the studio and See Art in
  Action.
LOCATION:T Barny Gallery & Sculpture Garden
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/see-art-in-action-at-t-
 barny-s-studio-tours/19907916/2026-10-11T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
