DESCRIPTION:We've laughed\, sipped\, danced\, and celebrated together all 
 summer long. Now it's time to ring in the fall season. Join us for the gra
 nd finale of our Summer Sundays series as DeLoach Vineyards transforms int
 o a vibrant harvest celebration filled with live music by Clay Bell\, loca
 l artisans\, delicious food\, and the warmth of community. Set against the
  backdrop of our vineyards during one of the most exciting times of the ye
 ar\, the Fall Harvest Festival is a celebration of everything we love abou
 t harvest season.\n\nDesigned with the whole family in mind\, the festival
  offers something for every age. Relax with seasonal wines by the glass or
  bottle\, harvest-inspired slushies\, and local food while browsing artisa
 n vendors. Kids of all ages are invited to enjoy pumpkin painting\, bobbin
 g for apples\, face painting\, and classic lawn games. Add in live enterta
 inment\, exciting raffle prizes\, and the beauty of autumn in the Russian 
 River Valley\, and you have the perfect way to welcome the season together
 .\n\n$25 per person | $15 per person (member) Children under 7 are complim
 entary.\n\nTicket includes a complimentary welcome pour for guests 21+.\n\
 nLarge party tickets with savings can be purchased here: https://www.explo
 retock.com/deloachvineyards/event/619514/fall-harvest-festival-6-ticket-bu
 ndle\n\nMusic to be performed by Clay Bell {https://www.claybell.me/}
LOCATION:DeLoach Vineyards
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/159659/t/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
