DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T170000
UID:261001CyHjMNb6AU-QhGVKaV_sBg
DESCRIPTION:The Russian River Ramblers are Sonoma County’s oldest tradit
 ional New Orleans-style jazz band. These talented musicians bring the spir
 it of early New Orleans Jazz to life\, inspired by the neighborhood danceh
 alls of a bygone era. With a repertoire of early jazz and ragtime standard
 s\, the Ramblers bring a delightful energy to every performance. Dance spa
 ce is available in front of the stage. Dry Creek Vineyard wines will be av
 ailable for sale before the show and during intermission. Tickets are $20 
 for one ticket\; $30 for two!
LOCATION:The Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/russian-river-ramblers/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
