BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://beelinerooftop.getbento.com/event/raw-rogue/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Raw & Rogue
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T210000
UID:260912ao_EHDrHSEKsu2N5sv5ZnQ
DESCRIPTION:For three Tuesdays this fall\, Raw \\+ Rogue brings an intimat
 e twelve-seat omakase experience to the rooftop of Appellation Healdsburg.
  Across twelve courses\, Chef Willer Larreal Perez—a Venezuela-born chef
  trained at omakase counters in Los Angeles and Miami—builds each dish a
 round the fish\, taking guests on a scenic culinary journey from the count
 er to the plate. An amuse opens the experience and dessert brings it to a 
 close\, while wine pairings from Baron Ziegler\, co-founder of Healdsburg
 ’s Banshee Wines and founder of Marine Layer\, move alongside the menu. 
 Each course is paired with its own song\, creating a soundtrack that build
 s plate by plate as the light shifts over Northern Sonoma County. Together
 \, the food\, wine and music create a multisensory evening designed to unf
 old in rhythm with the rooftop setting. \n\nWhen: Tuesdays | September 29
 \, October 13\, October 27 \\(6:30 pm\\) \n\nPrice: $295 per guest\, wine
  selections prices separately \n\nReservations are available through Open
 Table: Raw & Rogue \n\nPre-paid reservations are required.
LOCATION:Appellation Healdsburg
URL:https://beelinerooftop.getbento.com/event/raw-rogue/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-class/17159571/2026-10-13T18", "Press Democrat": "https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-class-intermediate-tuesday/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-class/17159571/2026-10-13T18"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Intermediate Salsa Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T193000
UID:260704BsOj6xXx5k-BM_s34KRcmg
DESCRIPTION:This class is designed for dancers who have a solid grasp of t
 he basics and are eager to expand their repertoire with more complex and f
 luid movements.\n\nPre- requisite:\n\nSalsa Class Beginners\n\nEach week\,
  we’ll break down a new move\, focusing on the technique and connection 
 that will make you a more confident and stylish dancer. We’ll go beyond 
 the foundational steps to cover a wide range of essential intermediate pat
 terns and styling\, including:\n\nTurns and Spins:\n\nMaster your inside a
 nd outside turns\, double spins\, and the elegant 360 and Hand Toss moves.
 \n\nIntricate Patterns:\n\nLearn to execute the 360\, wrap\, as well as va
 rious Cross Body Lead variations like the U-Turn and Spiral.\n\nFootwork a
 nd Styling:\n\nEnhance your rhythm and flair with advanced footwork like t
 he Suzy Q\, Front Tap\, and Mambo Step. We’ll also work on styling with 
 a wrap and improving your posture and upper body movement.\n\nThis class i
 s your chance to refine your technique\, improve your lead-follow connecti
 on\, and add a variety of fun and dynamic moves to your salsa vocabulary. 
 Join us and elevate your dance!\n\nDetails:\n\nNo partner necessary — ro
 tations ensure everyone gets to dance.\n\nPlease wear non-marking shoe so
 les to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 minutes early to warm up and get s
 ettled.\n\nDate & Time: Tuesdays @ 6:30PM – 7:30PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-clas
 s/17159571/2026-10-13T18
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
