DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T150000
UID:2610075PMRDyb23U-9J9V6X43v_Q
DESCRIPTION:Meet local farmers\, ranchers\, and artisans who are part of N
 orthern California's natural fiber ecosystem. The  Fibershed Winter Market
  showcases locally grown\, naturally dyed\, and minimally processed goods\
 , including undyed and naturally dyed yarn\, clothing\, knitted and croche
 ted pieces\, sheepskins\, soaps\, creams\, natural dye materials\, wool pe
 llets\, wool sponges\, batting\, pillows\, dryer balls\, and more. This co
 mmunity-focused market highlights sustainable practices and regional craft
 smanship\, offering guests a chance to connect directly with makers and ex
 plore high-quality fiber products created with care for the land and local
  economy.
LOCATION:Dance Palace
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/fibershed-winter-market-at-dance-palace/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
