 ms. Each event will be free and open to the SRJC community and hosted on c
 ampus.  Students who perform will be given a $50 incentive.Sign up to perf
 orm! (https://santarosajuniorcollege.formstack.com/forms/sounds_of_our_sto
 ry)Sounds of Our Story website. (https://petaluma.santarosa.edu/sounds-our
 -story)  This campus community event is funded by a grant from the Santa R
 osa Junior College Foundation Randolph Newman Cultural Enrichment Endowmen
 t.  All are welcome to attend!
