UID:c91271f8952431786947c56fc8376190@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, October 15th\, 6-8pm Intentional Living: Creating W
 hat's Next Get Your Tickets! An interactive workshop designed to create gr
 eater clarity around where you are\, what matters most\, and what you’d 
 like to create next. Through reflection\, guided prompts\, and the Vision 
 Wheel process\, you will explore the key areas of your life\, identify whe
 re you’d like to place more intention and attention\, and begin creating
  a clearer vision for what comes next. No artistic ability or prior experi
 ence needed — just curiosity\, excitement\, and anticipation for what yo
