DESCRIPTION:"Growing our Future!" Join us on Friday & Saturday\, October. 
 16-17\, from 9am - 4pm for the annual Fall Flower Show \\+ Plant Sale as w
 e HONOR CHILDREN everywhere. Location is the Graton Community Club\, 8996 
 Graton Road\, Downtown Graton\, CA. Invite your friends\, family and neigh
 bors. Enjoy live music\, plants\, Luncheon\, coffee and desserts\, Raffle 
 prizes\, white elephant gifts\, quilts\, garden art... something for every
 one! All are welcome\, always FREE admission. NEW THIS YEAR - help support
  our local schhol's Art Teachers! If you have gently used or new art \\+ c
 raft supplies you no longer want\, please bring them to the Flower Show on
  Oct.16-17! We will be accepting art/craft supply donations which will lat
 er be given to the art teachers at OakGrove \\+ Willowside Schools. The GC
 C building is ADA accessible and child friendly. We look forward to seeing
  you there! The Club is a nonprofit 501\\(c\\) 3\, tax ID \\#94-6093957. S
 ince 1954\, sales have benefited local student scholarships.
