SUMMARY:NRP Certification Class (AAP/AHA)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T120000
UID:260920PERQILC64UilO-t-XZyl6g
DESCRIPTION:NRP Certification Class \\(AAP/AHA\\)\n\nThe NRP certification
  class \\(Neonatal Resuscitation Program\\) is developed by the American A
 cademy of Pediatrics \\(AAP\\) in collaboration with the American Heart As
 sociation \\(AHA\\). This Blended Learning class consists of an online cou
 rse followed by an in-person Skills Session with an instructor. American A
 cademy of Pediatrics NRP Provider certifications are issued on the same da
 y.  \n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company with over 1\
 ,000 5-star reviews!  Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and expertly taugh
 t by professional first responders.\n\nLEARN MORE and ENROLL: https://vive
 cpr.com/class/heartcode-bls/\n\nCONTACT US: \\(707\\) 612-3277
LOCATION:Vive CPR
URL:https://vivecpr.com/class/nrp-certification/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.marincultural.org/exhibitions"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Formative Influence Art Exhibit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T160000
UID:260909NgckJ_lOmkikluPuEG6JhA
DESCRIPTION:Formative Influence explores the transformative power of light
  across five bodies of work. Inspired by the landscapes of Northern Califo
 rnia and the American West\, the exhibition examines the shift from photog
 raphy\, where light is observed and captured\, to painting\, where light i
 s created to shape new visual experiences. Rather than documenting the lan
 dscape\, these works evoke its emotional resonance\, emphasizing atmospher
 e\, memory\, and perception over literal representation.
LOCATION:Marin Center
URL:https://www.marincultural.org/exhibitions
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
