DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T200000
UID:261005caFngbFeF0S9AI7zhYUYrQ
DESCRIPTION:Price: $27\, $24 & $18 Adult\, $16\, $14 & $12 Child \\(12 and
  under\\) and Seniors \\(Marin Center fees included\\)\n\nTicket Info: htt
 ps://tickets.marincenter.org/eventperformances.asp?evt=496\n\nA grumpy ogr
 e who must rescue a cursed princess to get his peaceful swamp back from ex
 iled fairy tale creatures. Filled with brassy jokes\, catchy songs and lot
 s of heart\, this is a great show for the whole family. Run time is one ho
 ur and ten minutes with no intermission. All seating is assigned. Be sure 
 you are purchasing tickets for the cast you wish to see. Cast lists and mo
 re info can be found at\n\nwww.katiaandcompany.com
