DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of fun and creativity. In this 2-hour
  workshop\, we will create wonderful botanical designs with flowers\, herb
 s\, and leaves \, and more.\n\nWorking with an assortment of colors\, tex
 tures\, and materials to create a gorgeous one-of-a-kind tea towel or tote
  bag. While our items steam\, students will have the opportunity to explor
 e the art of Tataki Zome and wander the garden.\n\nPlease wear sturdy shoe
 s & bring water. \\(Light snacks provided while our magic steams\\). Parti
 cipants will go home with care instructions.\n\nInstructor bio: Lauren Ra
 cusin McSweeney is a skilled teacher who has worked with botanicals for ov
 er 10 years.
