UID:260831pcovyAMvWUef2xnvktnNTw
DESCRIPTION:Join Muscardini Cellars' for their  21st Harvest Celebration i
 n Sonoma Valley This special gathering features Cajun-style gumbo prepared
  by "Gumbo Dave" alongside barrel samples from various vintages. Head Wine
 maker Cecilia Valdivia will lead conversations about her winemaking journe
 y\, including her work with Michael Muscardini and their collaborations sp
 anning more than two decades. Guests will enjoy an intimate look at the wi
 nes\, traditions\, and relationships that have shaped Muscardini Cellars o
 ver the years. Choose from two seatings\, approximately 12:00-2:00 PM or 3
 :30-5:30 PM. Each seating is limited to 40 guests\, offering a relaxed and
  personal harvest experience./a\\>
