DESCRIPTION:Join us for a ***Halloween-themed*** afternoon turning **PEOPL
 E POWER** into **VOTER POWER with a Special Guest Speaker!**\n\n**NO KINGS
 : Trick or Vote Rally** will turn **people power into voter power**. Corru
 ption in Washington and the threats to our democracy and neighbors are rea
 l and they are scary. **On this NO KINGS\,** **let’s show the White Hous
 e something that will truly scare them: a nationwide mass mobilization of 
 citizens ready to vote early and make this election TOO BIG TO RIG!**\n\nO
 n October 17th\, we encourage you to come in a vote-themed costume or with
  a sign ready to find your pack and howl for democracy!\n\n👻 **VOTING**
  themed costumes encouraged\, **but please come with or without a costume 
 and any NO KINGS signs are welcome!**\n\n🍬 **Trick-or-treat** at commun
 ity tables (voter resources + lots of candy & treats)\n\n📸 **Strike a p
 ose** at the **Village Voters Photo Booth**\n\n🎤 **Special speaker**s w
 ill raise our spirits!\n\n🚶 Then grab your ghouls and join the **commun
 ity march**\n\n**Make your voice heard and get ready to howl for Democracy
 ! Let’s make this election TOO BIG TO RIG!**
LOCATION:Oxbow Commons
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/no-kings-4-vote-early-t
 rick-or-vote-rally/20109291/2026-10-17T13
