DESCRIPTION:Anova Center for Education (nonprofit school for neurodivergen
 t students)  is holding its ACE of Diamonds Gala at B.R. Cohn Winery on 
 **October 17th**\, our first gala in almost 10 years (since we lost our sc
 hool in the 2017 Tubbs Fire). We opened our new campus in January 2025 and
  this gala will celebrate the resilience of our community\, students and f
