  non-haunted family outdoor fun.  Crafts available afterward in the event
  barn.  Free admission\, but space is limited and pre-registration is req
 uired.  \n\nVolunteer opportunities available!  If you know students lo
 oking for hours\, we need parking safety attendants and forest trail assis
 tants.  Please email FarmYesNo@gmail.com\n\nWaiver is required of all att
 endees\, digitally before arrival\; we can process no waivers at the event
 .  Forest walk is optional\, but one must be able to walk one mile on une
 ven terrain.\n\nSorry\, no pets allowed.
LOCATION:Farm Yes No
URL:https://FarmYesNo.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
