DESCRIPTION:As the sun goes down\, Wonder transforms. Come dressed to glow
 \, shimmer\, sparkle\, or surprise and step into the galleries under ultra
 violet light\, where fluorescent colors come alive\, music fills the space
 \, and creativity turns into a nighttime celebration.\n\nWear a costume. D
 ress for the black lights. Be strange. Be magical. Be whoever you want to 
 be.\n\nPaint under black lights\, dance\, create\, explore\, laugh and mee
 t new people.\n\nAdd to the collaborative artwork and watch everything cre
 ated throughout Step Into Wonder glow in an entirely new way.\n\nYou don
 ’t need to be an artist. You don’t need an elaborate costume. Just com
 e ready to play\, create\, and experience Wonder after dark.\n\nBecause pl
 ay doesn’t belong only to children. And Wonder gets a little wilder afte
 r sunset.\n\nAges 18\\+ · Costumes encouraged
