 ing some of the nation’s top vocal harmony groups with winners of region
 al events flown to the Bay Area to compete for the title of National Champ
 ions. Began as a sing-a-long in a local pub the event has grown to become 
 a leading national showcase of a cappella music and has been called the 
 “Superbowl of A Cappella” by the San Francisco Chronicle. Always an en
 tertaining and enjoyable evening of top-notch singing we hope you can join
  us this year. You will have fun!
