DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T220000
UID:261009Mdq2mT2NNUWNA4e4I4cjIA
DESCRIPTION: \n\n \n\nHockey meets figure skating for a spooktacular \n\nn
 ight of Halloween entertainment on ice.\n\n \n\nGLITTER &amp\; GORE   \n\n
 Figure skaters and hockey players join forces for a wickedly entertaining 
 Halloween spectacular on ice.\n\nLocal hockey players pair up with profess
 ional figure skaters for a spirited night of thrills\, chills\, and Hallow
 een entertainment at Snoopy's Home Ice. Set to your favorite spooky songs\
 , Glitter &amp\; Gore brings the hockey and figure skating communities tog
 ether for an evening that's equal parts fabulous and frightful.\n\nSATURDA
 Y\, OCTOBER 17Showtime: 9 to 9:45 PM | Doors open: 8 PM\n\nSnoopy's Home I
 ce1667 West Steele Lane\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95403\n\nCome early and get into
  the Halloween spirit with drinks and snacks at the Warm Puppy Cafe before
  the show!\n\nPresented by Redwood Ice Theatre Company \\(501c3 non-profit
 \\)\n\n \n\n 
LOCATION:Snoopy's Home Ice
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/glitter-and-gore?aff=citys
 park
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_15c2778ff1500632209a3609f5dea164325b8db50375c24ebea8e22e3ab8dca8
X-SOURCE:Sonoma County DSA
DTSTART:20261017T220000Z
DTEND:20261018T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053403Z
UID:123499@google.com
CREATED:20261007T055801Z
DESCRIPTION:NO KINGS\, NO FLOCK - PROTEST IN SANTA ROSA OCTOBER 17thNo King
 s IV is upon us\, and DSA is hosting! We will be leading a march from SRJC 
 to Juilliard Park at 3:00pm on October 17th\, passing by the Halloween Mark
 et in the square along the way. The goal of this protest is to send a messa
 ge to our local electives as well as stand in solidarity with the Americans
  rising up around the country on this day. We will be rocking our giant QR 
 codes as usual\, but this time they will point to the "Flockinator"\, where
  protesters can input their address and immediately send a message to their
  local representative urging them to vote to eliminate Flock (and all stree
 t-mounted ALPRs) in their city.\nWant to help out? We would *LOVE* to have 
 you! [Please fill out this form indicating the roles you're interested in.]
 (https://discord.com/channels/1308831013237035018/1425576791799763004/15576
 51082925051986) We are especially looking for help with the Safety Team\, a
 nd are hosting a De-escalation training this Saturday!Not a member and stil
 l want to help out? Now is a *fantastic* time to join! DSA members are winn
 ing elections in droves\, but the hype train is only getting started. Join 
 fellow DSA members AOC and Mamdani in this fight for as little as NO COST t
 oday:  https://socodsa.org/join-dsa/\n[Cold Ones with Comrades](https://sol
 idarity.socodsa.org/cold-ones-with-comrades) will also take place immediate
 ly after the rally at Shady Oak Brewery\, right next door! After fighting t
 he good fight\, relax and have some drinks with friends (or make new ones!)
 .\n\nRSVP: https://solidarity.socodsa.org/no-kings-no-flock
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T191503Z
