 rust\, privacy\, accessibility\, and human connection shaped their work. P
 articipants will leave with practical ideas and inspiration for thoughtful
 ly exploring how AI tools can support their own work and advance student s
 uccess.  Viewing party at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd Floor\, #4832Registra
