 y for Sonoma County Public Educators\, and we'd love to invite you to join
  us.\n\nThe workshop will cover retirement planning concepts\, including r
 isk balancing\, tax considerations\, and strategies to help you think more
  intentionally about your retirement assets.\n\nWe are offering two dates:
