ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,900,900/716_c_square_Undocu-Immigrant-Logo-Pattern-J
 H.rev.1788894273.png
CATEGORIES:Department Events
DESCRIPTION:What happens when a student connects with an immigration legal
  services provider? Join a panel of legal services professionals for a con
 versation that demystifies the process and helps students and practitioner
 s better understand what to expect before\, during\, and after a legal con
 sultation. Our panelists will share how students can prepare for an appoin
 tment\, what a consultation may look like\, what happens after the meeting
 \, and how legal services teams support students in understanding their op
 tions and next steps. The conversation will also highlight the free and co
 nfidential immigration legal services available to California Community Co
 llege students and how practitioners can help connect students to these im
 portant resources.  Viewing party at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd Floor\, #4
 832Registration though Zoom. (https://foundationccc-org.zoom.us/webinar/re
 gister/WN_fVbuEsxwSVKM8lX4Ca26tw#/registration)For more information about 
 Undocumented Student Success Week\, visit the Undocu · Immigrant · Dream
  Center website. (https://dream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-2026-2027)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T185642Z
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/24106-behind-the-consultation-a-c
 onversation-with
