 h an immigration legal services provider? Join a panel of legal services p
 rofessionals for a conversation that demystifies the process and helps stu
 dents and practitioners better understand what to expect before\, during\,
  and after a legal consultation. Our panelists will share how students can
  prepare for an appointment\, what a consultation may look like\, what hap
 pens after the meeting\, and how legal services teams support students in 
 understanding their options and next steps. The conversation will also hig
 hlight the free and confidential immigration legal services available to C
 alifornia Community College students and how practitioners can help connec
 t students to these important resources.</p><p>  Viewing party at PAU Cent
 er - Bertolini 3rd Floor\, #4832</p><p><strong><a href="https://foundation
 ccc-org.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_fVbuEsxwSVKM8lX4Ca26tw#/registration" 
