DESCRIPTION:Come read your broadcast-friendly poetry live on air at OZCAT 
 radio. Hosted by DJ Lala\, Kathleen Herrmann and Tom Stanton.\n\nArrive at
  the studio by 10:15 AM to sign up for the list. Each poet takes turns at 
 the mic for a max of 3 minutes each. Depending on number of poets there ma
 y be multiple rounds.\n\nThe show can be heard worldwide through the TuneI
 n app\, internet streaming services\, or in Vallejo over the airwaves at 8
 9.5 FM.\n\nAccessibility notes: The studio is located in a historic home a
 nd only accessible by a short staircase and it also has dogs and cats on t
 he premises. We apologize if this causes any issues preventing your attend
 ance.
