 10.jpg
CATEGORIES:District Events
DESCRIPTION:The Green Living Fair will feature a variety of activities and
  resources\, including:A garment mending bar for simple clothing repairs  
 A clothing swap to give gently used clothing a new home  Bicycle repair as
 sistance  Small appliance repair  Freecycle giveaways featuring items avai
 lable for reuse  Upcycled crafts and other creative reuse activities  Info
 rmation from local organizations and SRJC clubs about sustainable living  
   Community members are encouraged to bring a garment\, bicycle\, small ap
 pliance\, and/or electronic item that needs repair. Those planning to brin
 g an item for mending are encouraged to sign up in advance.For more inform
 ation and to sign up for repair services\, visit the Sustainable SRJC webs
 ite. (https://sustainability.santarosa.edu/)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T182304Z
LOCATION:Bertolini Quad - Santa Rosa Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/24091-green-living-fair
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Green Living Fair will feature a var
 iety of activities and resources\, including:</p><ul><li>A garment mending
  bar for simple clothing repairs  </li><li>A clothing swap to give gently 
 used clothing a new home  </li><li>Bicycle repair assistance  </li><li>Sma
 ll appliance repair  </li><li>Freecycle giveaways featuring items availabl
 e for reuse  </li><li>Upcycled crafts and other creative reuse activities 
  </li><li>Information from local organizations and SRJC clubs about sustai
 nable living  </li></ul><p>  Community members are encouraged to bring a g
 arment\, bicycle\, small appliance\, and/or electronic item that needs rep
 air. Those planning to bring an item for mending are encouraged to sign up
  in advance.</p><p><a href="https://sustainability.santarosa.edu/" target=
 "_blank" rel="noopener">For more information and to sign up for repair ser
 vices\, visit the Sustainable SRJC website.</a></p>
