DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T190000
UID:589d8a118fdb8032a6564ffc7462054c@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:An intimate journey with whales from around the world\, and to
  help carry that journey north. Join Firuze for an Enchanting Show at Kell
 er Street CoWork on Thursday\, October 22\, at 4:30 PM. Prepare for an int
 imate exploration of whales from across the globe\, and help carry their j
 ourney northward. Each piece begins with sound\, drawing inspiration from 
 the waves and frequencies captured in recordings of killer whales\, humpba
 cks\, belugas\, and sperm whales. From this auditory foundation\, the artw
 ork transforms into a visual experience: the vocalizations of these magnif
 icent creatures expressed through color\, line\, and layered form. This ex
 hibition also serves as a fundraiser for my upcoming Arctic residency with
  The Arctic Circle\, where I will be sailing to Svalbard in the spring of 
 2027.
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/the-ocean-s-unseen
 -frequencies
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
