DESCRIPTION:As generative AI becomes embedded across disciplines\, higher 
 education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\, 
 but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities fo
 r research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depends en
 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Dave Kanter is an AI systems arch
 itect and engineering leader with provisional patent on agent feedback arc
 hitecture.Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website. (http
 s://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T182753Z
