DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing Used Goods & Dino’s Greek Food Truck**\n\nJoin us for a relaxed
  and lively Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our **Barrel Room**\, l
 ocated in **downtown Healdsburg**\, featuring live music\, award-winning w
 ine\, and fresh Mediterranean flavors. Our **Music\, Wine & Dine Night** p
 airs the feel-good\, crowd-friendly sounds of **Used Goods** with classic 
 Greek favorites from **Dino’s Greek Food Truck**.\n\nUsed Goods brings a
 n upbeat mix of familiar tunes and crowd favorites\, creating the perfect 
 soundtrack for a social evening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambi
 ance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by the glass or bottle while Dino’s Gree
 k Food Truck serves flavorful gyros and traditional Greek dishes\, made fr
 esh on site.\n\n**Friday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM** **Free entry**\n\n**Pleas
 e note:** This is an **over-21 event inside** the Barrel Room. **Under-21 
 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.**\n\nCome grab a se
 at early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of great music\, great wi
 ne\, and great food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live music by Used Goo
 ds Food by Dino’s Greek Food Truck (Greek cuisine and gyros) **Location:
 ** Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room **Address:** **5 Fitch Street\, Healdsb
 urg\, CA 95448**
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
