DESCRIPTION:Seventeen years of swampy tonk\, and the Mule is still kicking
 ! Join Miracle Mule at the legendary Rancho Nicasio for a birthday bash ce
 lebrating 17 years of music\, mischief\, and good times. Expect a rollicki
 ng mix of Americana\, honky-tonk\, roots rock\, and Louisiana-inspired gro
 oves\, with guitars\, accordion\, harmonica\, rubboard\, and plenty of rea
 sons to hit the dance floor.\n\nMiracle Mule has been entertaining Bay Are
 a audiences since 2009\, and we're pulling out the stops for this special 
 anniversary show. Bring your friends\, your dancing shoes\, and your appet
 ite for a great night out. Come early for dinner\, stay late for the music
 \, and help us celebrate 17 years of keeping the Mule alive and kicking!
