DESCRIPTION:Step into the wild\, witty world of “Little Shop of Horrors
 ”\n\nFeed the need for musical mayhem! The cult-classic smash hit LITTLE
  SHOP OF HORRORS is coming to Bay Area Stage Theatre on Broadway! Meet Sey
 mour\, Audrey\, and the most outrageous plant ever to take over a stage. P
 acked with unforgettable songs\, dark comedy\, romance\, and outrageous th
 rills\, this wildly entertaining musical will have audiences screaming for
  more!\n\nCast and crew - Victor Barajas: Seymour\, Joanna Lynn Costa: Aud
 rey\, Nathaniel Mercier: Orin Scrivello \\(The Dentist\\)\, Scott Slagle: 
 Mushnik\, Justin Daily: Voice of Audrey II\, Perris O'Neil: Urchin/Ronette
 \, Isabella Percy: Urchin/Crystal\, Maizzy Patton: Urchin/Chiffon\, Shanno
 n Tallchief: Ensemble\, Ava Butcher: Puppeteer and Rehearsal Assistant\, L
 orenzo Servente: Puppeteer\, Brian Sennello: Music Director\, Jeff Lowe: D
 irector\, Stacey Loew: Costume Designer\, Julia Blair: Assistant to the Di
 rector.
