 joins us in the elephant room after dinner to give a talk about human-carn
 ivore coexistence. The conservation dinner series is complimentary to all 
 dinner guests. If you want to attend this presentation\, please call our r
 eservations team at \\(707\\) 566-3667 or \\(800\\) 616-2695 and they can 
 book it for you. Dinner starts at 7:00 PM. From their website: "We collabo
 rate with local stakeholders to develop innovative approaches to promote h
 uman-carnivore coexistence … We believe that by protecting the needs of 
