DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T110000
UID:261009j2eMijs8bE2wa62ndUuU1g
DESCRIPTION:Marianne Benforado\, Licensed Acupuncturist and Certified Qi G
 ong Teacher will offer a mindful movement class at Barbieri Park in Healds
 burg on Saturday\, October 10 and Saturday\, October 24\, from 10–11 am.
  $20 drop in. Come to either or both!\n\nThere’s something really specia
 l about practicing Qi Gong outside. It's a good reminder that we’re part
  of Nature. We move with the trees\, feel our feet on the grass\, breathe 
 the fresh air\, listen to the birdies and take in the long view toward the
  hills and vineyards. All senses engaged!\n\nIt’s a beautiful way to get
  out of our heads for awhile. No experience is needed. Really! Just show u
 p and mirror the movements. Come a few minutes early to pay and get regist
 ered.
LOCATION:Barbieri Park
URL:https://feelbetteracu.com/events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
