UID:261001U3zvOwqzIkeLN5lWN0A5IA
DESCRIPTION:It's a Wrap! With Brad & Jim\n\nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026\n
 \n11:00 AM 3:00 PM\n\nat J. Rickards Winery\n\n*Celebrate the End of H
 arvest! Picnic with Brad & Jim on Saturday\, October 24th*\n\n11 am to 3 p
 m\n\nPicnic lunch is served from 12 to 2 pm\n\n*Brad Beard of Mercury Wine
  and our Jim Rickards come together to celebrate the end of harvest and w
 e would like for you to join us! This all happens at J. Rickards Winery!* 
 Attendance is limited to just 50 people for this intimate affair. $50 per 
 person\, ticket price includes selected wine samples during tasting and t
 alks\, picnic lunch\, and a glass of wine to pair with your lunch. Confir
 med reservations required. RSVP by October 20th. Please call 707-367-7741
 . You must be 21 years of age to attend. No pets please.  We look forwar
 d to you celebrating with us!\n\nCheers\, The J. Rickards and Mercury Tea
 m
