SUMMARY:4TH Annual American Roots Mini-Fest - Sonoma- Murphys
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T213000
UID:261010xNJdoJGwyUqZxJqk7qzXDQ
DESCRIPTION:4TH Annual American Roots Mini-Fest Downtown Sonoma - 3 bands 
 in The Alley at Murphys\, Sat\, Oct 24 2:30-9:30\, Outdoors\, all day... H
 attie Craven\, Back pOrchEstra and The Wild Premonitions.\n\n"Something Ne
 w and Something Familiar"... Roots Rock\, Americana\, Country Blues\, West
 ern Swing\, Cajun\, and New Orleans music...\n\nno cover\, Tip the perform
 ers! $10\\+ donation suggested\n\nHattie Craven 2:30-4:00\n\nHattie Craven
  has lived and breathed music since her early years with her father\, awar
 d-winning performer Joe Craven. Hattie draws musical influences from Amy W
 inehouse\, Joni Mitchell\, James Brown\, Louis Prima\, and so many more. S
 he effectively reimagines traditional folk\, bluegrass\, country\, jazz an
 d pop\,\n\ncreating new music that is truly her own. Hattie is also a fine
  writer of original songs that explore themes of love\, loss and resilienc
 e. https://www.hattiecraven.com\n\nBack pOrchEstra: 4:45-6:45\n\nSemi-Acou
 stic Original Indie Rock & the American Roots\n\nthat inspired it: Country
  Blues\, Cajun\, Roots Rock\,\n\nAmericana\, Singer/Songwriter music with 
 rich tones:\n\nCandy Girard\, Tim Eschliman\, Steve Black\,\n\nJen Rund\, 
 Luis Rodriguez... originals and reworked classics by Hank Williams\, Taj M
 ahal\, Dan Hicks\, NRBQ\, JJ Cale\, Big Al Amderson\, Big Bill Broonzy\, B
 ob Wills\, Jimmy Reed\, Joseph & Cleome Falcon... recent single: https://o
 rcd.co/7jjvmmx ... "What Does Your Heart Say?" - a Breezy west coast rock\
 , a hopeful idealistic Americana love song duet\, celebrating the new "Sto
 ries In The Heart" album\, listen now!: https://orcd.co/5xga7nr\n\nhttps:/
 /www.BackpOrchEstra.com\n\nThe Wild Premonitions: 7:30-9:30\n\nA never-bef
 ore summit of players... an experiment of many genres: Rock\, Blues\, Jazz
 \, Funk\, Zydeco... Mike Rinta\, Tim Eschliman\, Roy Blumenfeld\, Kevin Zu
 ffi and Ian Lamson... players from The Blues Project\, Rhythmtown-Jive\, L
 ouisiana Time Travelers\, Sly Stone\, Commander Cody & His Western Airmen.
 \n\n464 1st St E\, Sonoma\, CA 95476 \\(707\\) 935-0660\n\nSongs from all 
 over the map!...\n\nsee also\n\nRoy Blumenfeld: https://bluesproject.net/b
 ios/\n\nhttp://www.rhythmtown-jive.com\n\nhttps://www.mikerintamusic.com\n
 \nhttps://timeschliman.com/LouisianaTimeTravelers.html\n\nCommander Cody &
  His Western Airmen YouTube Playlist: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL
 SGImH0Ow80I&si=ib9D\\_7PpEiKJ2rFn\n\nPreview the music:\n\nThe Blues Proje
 ct\, Hattie Craven\, Back pOrchEstra \, Roy Blumenfeld\, Rhythmtown-Jive\,
  Mike Rinta -\n\n4TH Annual American Roots Mini-Fest Playlists:\n\n... on 
 youTube:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLEi6QQx2MsMM\n\n...on S
 potify:\n\nhttps://open.spotify.com/playlist/17CVSLarIOMxTN03uhfFTA?si=F-\
 \_4lWBQRkaVzVX89lIc3A
LOCATION:Murphy's Irish Pub
URL:https://www.BackpOrchEstra.com/shows.html
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
