SUMMARY:Mare Island Halloween Block Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T200000
UID:26092458bZPtpDDEeqwl9MV0HyWQ
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a frightfully fun adventure along the ghostly ch
 arm of Walnut Avenue and Officers Row\, with entrances near the mysterious
  Vino Godfather Mansion and Alden Park — now home to some spooky zombie 
 fun!\n\n🎃 This Halloween celebration has thrills and chills for every g
 houl and goblin in your family:\n\n🧟 NEW this year: Zombie fun has take
 n over Alden Park — perfect for photos and a little extra Halloween exci
 tement for the whole family.\n\n🍬 Little monsters can dive into bone-ch
 illing fun with trick-or-treating\, creative pumpkin decorating\, and magi
 cal face painting transformations.\n\n🐕 Four-legged friends are invited
  to the party! Our "Howl-o-ween" costume contest promises to be pawsitivel
 y exciting.\n\n🎵 Dance to our haunting playlist while savoring delectab
 le bites from our lineup of food trucks\, warming up with creamy hot choco
 late\, and enjoying a cauldron full of festive drinks.\n\nShow off your mo
 st creative costumes\, bring your favorite humans \\(and pets!\\)\, and pr
 epare for a monstrously memorable evening at this Halloween spectacular. 
 🦉🍁\n\nFREE ADMISSION – Just RSVP to secure your spot! All trick-or
 -treaters ages 13 & under receive a complimentary Halloween goodie bag whi
 le supplies last.
LOCATION:Walnut Avenue - Officer's Row\, Mare Island
URL:https://www.mareislandco.com/news-events/halloween2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
