DESCRIPTION:We LOVE our members! On Sunday and Monday mornings members get
  exclusive access to the Museum for the first hour! \n\nAll Children’s M
 useum members enjoy these benefits:  \n\n\n\nFree admission during regul
 ar\, open days\n\nExclusive entrance to the museum during our Sunday Membe
 r Mornings \n\n$2.00 discounts on each admission for up to six additional
  guests \n\nDiscounted rates on Gift Corner purchases\, Private Playdates
 \, birthday parties\, and admission to select events \n\n$1.00 discounts 
 on each admission for up to four persons to the Schulz Museum and Snoopy
 ’s Home Ice Arena \n\n\n\nInterested in becoming a member? Check out o
 ur affordable Membership Levels here.
LOCATION:Children's Museum of Sonoma County
