SUMMARY:Bird of Prey Hike at Lynch Canyon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T140000
UID:261007NnyRdjue0k-IPEF6HxhpHw
DESCRIPTION:Each year from fall through late winter West County Hawkwatch 
 leads weekend hikes so people can learn about the birds of prey that call 
 the Solano Land Trust properties their home.\n\nDuring this viewing season
 \, bring your binoculars and join a group to see the magnificent bids that
  rely on our protected agricultural open spaces for habitat. Birders of al
 l levels of experience are welcome.\n\nFor a complete schedule of West Cou
 nty Hawkwatch events\, visit the group’s website at: westcountyhawkwatch
 .com or its Facebook page.\n\n\\*Photo credit: Pamela Hawken \\(Pamelarose
 hawkenphotography.com\\)
LOCATION:Lynch Canyon Open Space
URL:https://solanolandtrust.org/events-news/event-calendar.html/event/2026
 /10/25/bird-of-prey-hike-at-lynch-canyon-october-25th/573934
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
