UID:260915GY3qepo2Q0WghcJa-SLacw
DESCRIPTION:Directions:\n\nMeet at the playground \\(2 Toby Street\, Point
  Reyes Station\\). Parking in the lot is limited.\n\nSponsor: Parks\n\nAcc
 ommodation Information: If you are a person with a disability and require 
 an accommodation to participate in a County program\, service\, or activit
 y\, requests may be made by calling 415-473-438 1 \\(Voice\\)\, Dial 711 f
 or CA Relay\, or by submitting a\n\nDisability Accommodation Request\n\nat
  least five business days in advance of the event. We will do our best to 
 fulfill requests received with less than five business days' notice. Copie
 s of documents are available in alternative formats upon request.\n\nGet r
 eady to unleash your creativity and embrace the Halloween spirit with our 
 Rang ers! Join us for a fun-filled family pumpkin carving session where yo
 u can craft your very own spooky Jack-O-Lantern. Appropri ate for all ages
 . We will provide all carving material s and a limited number of pumpkins 
 \\(you are welcome to bring your own\\). Friendly dogs are welcome on a le
 ash. Adverse weather or poor air quality may cancel. Check the calendar or
  text/call \\(4 15\\) 798-6338 two hours before the event to confirm the s
 tatus. Reg istration is required.\n\nQuestions: Contact\n\nReilani Peleti
LOCATION:Point Reyes Playground
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
