X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sec.regfox.com/oct2026moon-bald", "Press Democrat": "https://sec.regfox.com/oct2026moon-bald", "Visit Santa Rosa": "https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/full-moon-hike-9/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sec.regfox.com/oct2026moon-bald"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Full Moon Hike
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T194500
UID:261001YcfqK7UTc0qX2tddC0c72Q
DESCRIPTION:Bring a flashlight and your sense of wonder as you e
 xplore the park after dark. This hike heads up to the summit o
 f Bald Mountain\, where we will see the moon rise over the May
 acamas and the sun set over Sonoma Valley. This is a strenuous
  hike of approximately 6.5 miles with 1500+ of vertical and som
 e steep sections (not recommended for children under 12).\n\n**Mee
 t at the main parking lot at least 10 minutes prior to the st
 art time**. Advance registration is $10 for general admission\, o
 r $5 for youth (12-17 year olds)\, students\, Sugarloaf members\,
  Sugarloaf or RFO volunteers. All minors must be accompanied by
  a parent or legal guardian. **You must register on this page 
 to attend\; tickets on site are $15** (exact change only) **and m
 ight not be available.** Bring your **flashlight**\, **at least 3
 2oz of water**\, **snacks**\, and **extra layers for the evening*
 *. Parking fees apply.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/oct2026moon-bald
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://eventvesta.com/events/160340/t/tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Haunted Wine Tour & Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T173000
UID:260831stOEelfnbUKc9sFARVkF7Q
DESCRIPTION:This fall\, Buena Vista Winery invites you to uncover the myst
 eries\, legends\, and ghostly encounters woven into more than 165 years of
  history. Led by Sonoma historian and actor George Webber\, this immersive
  90 minute experience journeys through the historic Press House and Champa
 gne Cellars\, revealing true tales of unexplained happenings reported by B
 uena Vista team members and visitors throughout the years.\n\nHear the sto
 ries of the Glowing Ghostly Shirt\, the Little Girl Who Says Hi\, the myst
 erious Ghost Party on the Second Floor\, the Old Man Who Walked Into a Sto
 ne Wall\, and other strange occurrences that continue to add to the legend
  of Buena Vista.\n\nAlong the way\, explore some of the winery’s most in
 triguing spaces\, including the Bubble Lounge\, Cave of Curiosities\, and 
 Wine Tool Museum\, while enjoying five Buena Vista wines tasted throughout
  the experience\, including a taste drawn directly from barrel.\n\nAnd\, a
 s with any journey through Buena Vista’s extraordinary past\, you never 
 quite know when the winery’s legendary founder\, Count Agoston Haraszthy
 \, may choose to make an appearance.\n\nHistory\, wine\, mystery\, and per
 haps a spirit or two await.
LOCATION:Buena Vista Historical Winery
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/160340/t/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/classes/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Move N Groove
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T170000
UID:260319qy4htMBGAkqcQeTOl7gRbA
DESCRIPTION:Find Your Rhythm with James Darling Looking for a fun way to 
 stay active? Join James for a fun dance session designed for everyone. We
 ’re turning up the volume on the world’s biggest pop hits—come expre
 ss yourself and leave it all on the floor!\n\nNo stress: Every song uses 
 repetitive moves so you’ll be a pro by the final chorus.\n\nGet confiden
 t: We rotate the same playlist all month long\, giving you plenty of time
  to master the groove.\n\nJoin the party!\n\nAt Move N Groove\, we care m
 ore about your smile than your footwork. This isn’t just a cardio dance 
 class\; it’s a high-energy trip through musical theater\, world beats\, 
 and your favorite hits from every decade.\n\nCome sweat\, laugh\, and danc
 e like nobody’s watching.\n\nAbout James\n\nPutting the fun in fitness f
 or over 30 years!\n\nI’ve been teaching and developing challenging class
 es that put the joy in enjoyment. Our bodies need to keep moving to mainta
 in balance\, strength\, flexibility\, and so much more. Why not make it fu
 n?\n\nThe more we move the better we feel. It’s proven that the only way
  to keep your body in tip top shape is to keep going. So why not have a fa
 bulous time while doing it? Come to class and see how your thoughts on mov
 ement will shift towards a happier more fulfilled experience at the gym.\n
 \nDATE AND TIME: Mondays\, 4:00 PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/classes/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
