DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nHello Educators and f
 riends of Educators\,\n\n**If you are a teacher or know of anyone in the e
 ducation industry that you feel would benefit from this "Teachers' Worksho
 p\," please share this event and information.**\n\nHuls Financial and Insu
 rance Solutions is hosting a free retirement planning workshop specificall
 y for Sonoma County Public Educators\, and we'd love to invite you to join
  us.\n\nThe workshop will cover retirement planning concepts\, including r
 isk balancing\, tax considerations\, and strategies to help you think more
  intentionally about your retirement assets.\n\nWe are offering two dates:
 \n**October 20th at 6 PM**\n**October 27th at 4:30 PM.**\n\nLocation:\n**2
 455 Bennet Valley Rd.\, Suite B102**\n**Santa Rosa\, CA 95404**\n\nThere i
 s no cost to attend. *Please note that this even is **not** sponsored\, en
 dorsed\, or hosted by **any** Sonoma County Public School District. It is 
 independently hosted by **Huls Financial and Insurance Solutions**.*\n\nIf
  you would like to attend\, please RSVP at the link below with your prefer
 red date so that we can reserve your spot.\n\nWe hope to see you there!\n\
 n**RSVP Link**: [https://forms.gle/eUsjjpJDupTysf7LA](https://forms.gle/eU
 sjjpJDupTysf7LA "https://forms.gle/eUsjjpJDupTysf7LA")
