DESCRIPTION:Join us every Tuesday evening at 6:00 pm for a relaxing hike a
 long the Vallejo waterfront.\n\nThese hikes are beginner-friendly\, family
 -friendly\, dog-friendly and welcoming to all fitness levels! It will be a
  time to relax\, reset\, and focus on enjoying good company\, and peaceful
  transition from work into the rest of your evening.\n\nWhether you're new
  to hiking\, looking to meet new friends\, or simply want a healthy way to
  decompress\, we'd love to have you with us. Let's enjoy Vallejo's trails 
 together. See you Tuesday!\n\nEvery evening\, 6:00 pm to 7:30 pm. Meetup a
 t the Vallejo ferry terminal\, Vallejo.
