 he title of judges’ top cocktail and the people’s choice award. Procee
 ds from the event will benefit Una Vida and Petaluma Active 20-30\, Petalu
 ma-based nonprofits providing vital community support for families and und
 erserved children. Food will be available for purchase via sit-down quick 
 service from Brewsters Beer Garden.\n\n General admission is from 6:30 
 – 8:30 p.m. and VIP admission is from 5:30 – 8:30 p.m. VIP ticket hold
 ers receive early admission and complimentary VIP-only appetizers and more
 . VIP tickets are limited and available online only before October 27th. 
 \n\nAll ticket holders must be 21 years or older to attend with valid ID r
 equired to enter.\n\nHalloween costumes encouraged\, with a prize for the 
 best costume!\n\n This event is sponsored by The Perfect Purée of Napa V
 alley\, Charbay Distillery\, Una Vida\, and Petaluma Active 20-30.
