DESCRIPTION:The 4th Annual Job & Resource Fair for those who are unshelter
 ed and at risk will be on October 28th 11-2 pm at the Sonoma County Fairgr
 ounds This truly collaborative event is sponsored by many nonprofit\, publ
 ic organizations\, employers and community volunteers. This event is possi
 ble due to generous donations and community grants.\n\nOver 50 employers a
 nd resource providers will be attending this year's event and will offer e
 xcellent job opportunities as well as important resources for the unshelte
 red or at risk.  Attendees are eligible for gift cards and can take advan
 tage of an on-site resume clinic along with Free Haircuts. Lunch and snack
 s will be provided.
LOCATION:Sonoma County Fairgrounds
