UID:260319WWOlh_47N0CQCALfoVhz7Q
DESCRIPTION:Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?\n\nAre you a 
 salsa dancer who has the basics down but is ready to add more? Our Interme
 diate Salsa Class with Tyler is designed to help you transform your dancin
 g moves. In this class\, you’ll go beyond the basics to learn intricate 
 footwork\, enhance your leading and following skills\, and master the body
  movement that will make you shine on the dance floor. This class is for a
 nyone ready to learn the techniques and intermediate steps needed to take 
 their dancing to the next level.\n\nYou’ll learn intermediate dancing te
 chniques that will help you:\n\nExpress yourself with sharper footwork and
  styling.\n\nMaster complex turn patterns and combinations.\n\nStrengthen 
 your lead and follow for seamless\, connected dancing.\n\nAdapt to differe
 nt partners and music with ease on the social dance floor.\n\nWhat to Expe
 ct: Instructor Tyler blends a fun\, supportive atmosphere with structured
  lessons\, so you’re always challenged but never overwhelmed. Helping yo
 u progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n\nDe
 tails:\n\nNo partner necessary—rotations ensure everyone dances.\n\nPlea
 se wear non-marking shoes to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 minutes ear
 ly to warm up and get settled.\n\nWhen: Fridays\, 6:30 PM – 7:30 PM\n\n
 Instructor: Tyler Crandall\n\nWhere: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Raf
 ael\, CA
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-with
 -tyler/17624477/2026-10-30T18
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"GoLocal Cooperative": "https://golocal.coop/event/spooky-skies/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_c_rilc5rtgatnr4oln08fo9p5k30
SUMMARY:Spooky Skies
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T210000
DTSTAMP:20261010T053359Z
UID:1ji640n910dgilf04qn4m1km65@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T183000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20251125T235833Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><i>When the nights grow longer... the skies get spookier!</
 i></p><p>Celebrate Halloween under the stars at <b>Spooky Skies</b>\, a f
 rightfully fun evening of cosmic chills and celestial thrills at the <b>R
 obert Ferguson Observatory</b>! As darkness falls over Sugarloaf Ridge Sta
 te Park\, our astronomers will guide you through eerie tales of the night 
 sky—ghostly nebulae\, vampire stars\, and mysterious cosmic phenomena th
 at are stranger than fiction.</p><p>Peer through our telescopes for a haun
 tingly beautiful view of the Moon\, planets\, and distant galaxies shimmer
 ing in the autumn sky. Come in costume if you dare—there will be treats\
 , spooky science activities\, and fun for all ages!</p><p>So grab your red
  flashlight\, bundle up\, and join us for an out-of-this-world Halloween c
 elebration that’s more wonder than fright—but just a little bit spooky
 .</p><p><i>Family-friendly event. Costumes encouraged but not required!</i
 ></p><p>Attendance is limited. Register at <a href="http://rfo.simpletix.c
 om">rfo.simpletix.com</a>. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251219T232750Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Robert Ferguson Observatory, GoLocal Cooperative
END:VEVENT
