DESCRIPTION:April & Monroe Grisman The Beautiful Hang Gang \nApril & Monroe Grisman have spent their lives surrounded by music\, art and the creative community of Marin County and the San Francisco Bay Area. Those roots continue to shape the original music they make today with The Beautiful Hang Gang\, a collective of longtime friends and Bay Area musicians blending Americana\, soul\, reggae & rock & roll with big\, rich vocal harmonies.
