DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T150000
UID:260713N2LlHTUnm0KWVQk1aAII0w
DESCRIPTION:Start your Halloween festivities at this daytime\, family-frie
 ndly event! Enjoy trick-or-treating at the vendor booths while checking ou
 t what our super creative local vendors have to offer. Get lunch while you
 're there\, thanks to the La Fogata taco truck\, and enjoy Halloween music
  playing in the background. Show up in costume and get your Halloween goin
