 a at Greystone this Halloween. For one night only\, we are throwing open t
 he cellar doors to welcome you to the Last Rites: Speakeasy Supper Club fo
 r a thrilling 1928 Prohibition-era dinner party\, including a lavish five-
 course harvest dinner\, wines\, and spirits. But beware that the spirits i
 n your glass might not be the only ones lingering in the room. \n\nPurcha
 se your tickets for a hauntingly good evening before they vanish into the 
 night!
