X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Focaccia + Wine
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T140000
UID:261002ZnrS1DWVLE61AhQI0-gLXw
DESCRIPTION:Kinda like brunch\, but better.\n\nJoin us for a relaxed after
 noon of fresh focaccia\, Adruni wine\, vineyard views\, and a little creat
 ivity around the table.\n\nWe’ll welcome you to Adruni Vineyards with a 
 glass of their inaugural sparkling wine release and sweeping views of Dr
 y Creek Valley. From there\, find your seat and settle in—this isn't you
 r traditional cooking class.\n\nBreanna of Riverbend Farm Stand will have 
 the sourdough prepared and ready for you to get straight to the fun part. 
 She’ll show you how to stretch and dimple your dough before you make you
 r way through a beautiful\, seasonal topping bar to create a focaccia enti
 rely your own.\n\nThere’s no long sourdough lesson or pressure to get it
  perfect. Breanna will be alongside you to guide\, answer questions\, and 
 handle the baking while you sip\, create\, and enjoy the afternoon.\n\nOnc
 e the focaccia goes into the oven\, we’ll gather back around the table f
 or a taste of Adruni wines and light accompaniments while everything bakes
 .\n\nAnd you won't leave empty-handed.\n\nYour freshly baked focaccia is y
 ours to take home\, along with a Riverbend Farm Stand sourdough starter an
 d care guide so you can try your hand at it again in your own kitchen.\n\n
 Come with a friend or come on your own. Either way\, we'll save you a seat
  at the table.\n\nSunday\, November 1 Adruni Vineyards | Dry Creek Valley 
 $145 per person Limited to just 12 guests\n\nAdditional Adruni wines will
  be available for purchase during the afternoon.
LOCATION:Adruni Vineyards
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/focaccia-wine-tickets-2002485607357?aff=e
 bdssbdestsearch
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
