DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Magdalena Bogart\nDate: Monday\, November 2nd\nTi
 me: 2:30PM-5:30PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nIn my ong
 oing Gel-Printing & Collage workshop I want to offer you the opportunity 
 to collage with your handmade papers\, starting with an easy project prog
 ressing each class to a more challenging one.\n\nI will demonstrate techn
 iques for making papers with and without the Gel-Plate. We will create a 
 collection of cohesive\npapers. The best of them you will use for your co
 llage projects.\n\nSome examples are a fish\, a butterfly\, a vase with f
 lowers\, a grouping of various cups and more.\n\nOne requirement for this
  class is that you are familiar and comfortable cutting shapes with an X-
 Acto knife or a similar tool.\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please c
 ontact Magdalena at: 408.781.2589 or by email\nat: mailto:mag.bogart@gmai
