 ersonalized portrait of your pet! Here's how it works: Registration Instru
 ctions:In your registration email\, please use the subject line "Paint You
 r Pet 11/3/26" and include your name \\(or the name of the person painting
 \\) along with a well-lit\, clear headshot of your pet's face. We recommen
 d a photo taken at your pet's level to capture all the details. Email: inf
 o@asipofcolor.com info@asipofcolor.com Pre-Event Preparation:Prior to the 
 event\, our hosting Artist will pre-sketch your pet's face onto your canva
 s. At the Event:Learn step-by-step techniques to paint your pet's unique t
