SUMMARY: Take the art of Still Life to new places
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Sandra Novia\n\nDates: This is a 6-class series\,
  meeting 6 Fridays: October 30th\, November 6th\, 13th\, 20th\, 27th & De
 cember 4th.\n\nTime: 2:30pm - 4:30pm.\n\nLocation : Santa Rosa Store\n\nF
 ee: $310 for 6 classes.\n\nThis class is an ongoing series. You can regis
 ter and start at anytime. Please contact instructor for more details.\n\n
 This class is for art explorers of all levels!\n\nCreating a still life i
 s about waking up your observational skills. Moving through different med
 iums\, we will embark on a journey together\, exploring how to apply many
  art forms and techniques to express what you see in life.\n\nIn this six
  week course\, each class will explore a different art medium. We will dr
 aw and paint with graphite\, watercolor pencils and acrylic. We will expa
 nd on those mediums as we move into printmaking\, collage\, and mosaic to
  bring your art to life. It's a great class to learn the fundamentals for
  beginners and for experienced artists that want to try their hand at a n
 ew art form you haven't done before.\n\nAll levels Welcomed.\n\nLet's exp
 lore the beautiful art of expressing Art together.\n\n\nTo register for t
 his series\, please contact Sandra Novia at: (707) 433-ARTS (2787)\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Mixed-Media
