 d you like spiritual tools to change that?**\n\n**Are you ready to awaken 
 to your full**\n**spiritual potential through your dreams?**\n\nCome to th
 is FREE online workshop on dreams!\n\n"As Soul\, you have the God knowledg
 e within you."\n—Harold Klemp\, *Raise Your Spiritual IQ!\,* inside cove
 r\n\nThis workshop explores different ways to understand your own dream la
