 reet\, Santa Rosa Instructor: Anne Millett Date: Tuesday\, November 10th 
 Time: 11:00AM-2:30PM Fee: $45.00...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
