UID:c06df2596e8799e34ef24b0bad2e3ba5@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Come to the park for a peaceful hike through the woods on Mond
 ay\, November 11! Join our Docents on this fun family hike that is good fo
 r all ages\, where you will learn about Sugarloaf Park\, its plants\, anim
 als\, and history. The hike begins from the Visitor Center. One option hea
 ds down to the waterfall on the 2-mile Pony Gate-Canyon loop\, while a sec
 ond\, shorter option will meander along the Creekside Nature Trail. Please
  note the route is bound to change depending on logistics such as wet cros
 s
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park\, 2605 Adobe Canyon Road\, Kenwood\, C
 A 95452
