DESCRIPTION:Sips and Stars ~ an evening of fine wine and cosmic wonder.<br
 ><br>Join us for a magical night under the stars at the Robert Ferguson Ob
 servatory! Our Sips &amp\; Stars event blends the beauty of the night sky 
 with the elegance of Sonoma County wine. Enjoy a curated tasting experienc
 e hosted by Landmark Vineyards\, known for their exceptional Chardonnay an
 d Pinot Noir\, while taking in breathtaking views of the cosmos through ou
 r powerful telescopes.<br><br>As twilight falls\, relax with a glass of wi
 ne in hand and listen to engaging astronomy talks from our knowledgeable d
 ocents. Once darkness settles\, step up to the observatory’s telescopes 
 for guided viewing of planets\, star clusters\, and distant galaxies.<br><
 br>Whether you’re a wine lover\, stargazer\, or simply looking for a uni
 que evening out in Sonoma Valley\, Sips &amp\; Stars promises an unforgett
 able experience where earthly pleasures meet celestial beauty.<br><br>Gues
 ts must be 21 or older to attend and each registration includes two drink 
 tickets. Proceeds support the Robert Ferguson Observatory’s public educa
 tion programs.<br><br>Space is limited - register at <a href="https://www.
 google.com/url?q=http://rfo.simpletix.com&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&a
 mp\;ust=1764544448962222&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0sTmjSxZX_yb3OnkvCofkQ" target="_b
 lank">rfo.simpletix.com</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251219T232905Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Robert Ferguson Observatory
END:VEVENT
