DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTSTAMP:20261008T193122
CREATED:20260819T063055Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260819T063055Z
UID:10000399-1794614400-1794700799@ranchonicasio.com
SUMMARY:BIG BROTHER & THE HOLDING COMPANY
DESCRIPTION:Dinner Show with BIG BROTHER & THE HOLDING COMPANY\n\nBig Brother & The Holding Company are considered\, along with the Grateful Dead and Jefferson Airplane\, the pioneers of the “San Francisco Sound”. They are also the band that launched the career of Janis Joplin.\n\nThey are the band that recorded ‘Cheap Thrills’\, which has been voted by Rolling Stone as one of the greatest classic rock albums of all time and which\, along with their hit version of “Piece of My Heart” is in the Grammy Hall of Fame\, and the Library of Congress. Their energy\, spirit and their story define a time when music was at the center of a cultural revolution\, yet their music is still listened to and loved.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/big-brother-the-holding-company-2/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Big-Brother-resized.jpg
END:VEVENT
