SUMMARY:Paper Basket Twining — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, Californ
 ia
DTSTART:20261122T000000
DTEND:20261123T000000
UID:3ec469bd7187728da341e6246b7eed70@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Paper Basket Twining\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          
 $160.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nPaper Basket Twining Sunday\, Novem
 ber 22nd\, 2026 10:00am-3:00pm $150.00 + $10.00 Materials Fee In this clas
 s\, students will learn the art of basket twining to crest a unique basket
 . Students will be using Japanese paper cord\, and will learn to lay out s
 poke\, twine around them\, add color\, and create a polished finishing loo
 k. All Materials Provided. There will be discussion breaks throughout the 
 class\, as well as a lunch break. Please bring a paper bag lunch. About th
 e Teacher: Carrie Botto is a self taught multi-medium weaver. She started 
 weaving with beads over 40 years ago and continues to add skills and techn
 iques to her “tool box”. Carrie travels all over the country now teach
 ing several different classes\, and has taught at Mendocino Art Center\, N
 ew Mexico Bead Trader\, Moab Art Center\, and Fiber on 4th in New Mexico. 
 Follow Carrie on Instagram @beanstreetsudio! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          \n            \n           
    \n                Add to cart
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 
 95472
URL:https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/paper-basket-twining
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
