SUMMARY:DANNY CLICK & the Hell Yeahs!
DESCRIPTION:Dinner Show with DANNY CLICK & the Hell Yeahs! Birthday Bash! \n\nUntil a few years ago\, Danny Click was one of Austin’s best-kept secrets\, a musician’s musician who’d won the respect of some of alt-country’s biggest names but hadn’t yet found widespread recognition. \nThat changed when Click’s latest CD\, Life Is A Good Place\, was released in April\, 2011 and spent more than 12 consecutive months on the Country\, pop\, and Americana radio charts.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/danny-click-the-hell-yeahs-5/
