 esser-known gems that often highlight the influence of tango and jazz. Thi
 s piano trio has established itself as a diverse ensemble with a wide-rang
 ing repertoire.For more information and tickets\, visit SRJC's Chamber Con
 cert Series website. (https://chamberconcerts.santarosa.edu/)
