DESCRIPTION:Advanced Colored Pencil Workshop with Nina Antze (December 202
 6)\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $45.00\n        \n      \n    
 \n  \n\nAdvanced Colored Pencil Workshop Tuesday\, December 8th\, 2026 10:
 00am-1:00pm $45.00These workshops are geared to the advanced\, ongoing stu
 dents who want in-person instruction and feedback on their colored pencil 
 projects. Please consult the instructor\, Nina\, for details before signin
 g up\, by emailing antze@pcquilt.com. About the Teacher: Nina Antze is a b
 otanical artist\, quilt maker\, and teacher living in Sonoma County. She h
 as a degree in Fine Arts from San Francisco State University and has a Cer
 tificate in Botanical Illustration from the New York Botanical Gardens. He
 r paintings are part of the Filoli Florilegium and Alcatraz Florilegium. \
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n         
