BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Occidental Center for the Arts": "https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/rest-renew-monthly-sound-bath-l5n5c-wchlw-38gmc-rw262-hd6w3-nlnhm-bn8b8-d74pg-d79je-wx3an-ampe7-zckp7-gndtj-32c6f-4y8an-wsmxr-y3rtb-8k62p-lx4gx-36kl7-5kgyd-tbetg-2kydp-p4x58"}
X-SOURCE-ID:occidental_arts
SUMMARY:Sound Bath with Laura Benson
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T203000
UID:69ade3a276bfec58ebd6ab58@squarespace.com
DESCRIPTION:Rest & Renew at our Sound Bath!\nSupport your nervous system\,
  release anxiety and stress\, and harmonize your body\, mind and spirit on
  the 2nd Tuesday of every month! Laura Benson has a Masters in Intuition M
 edicine(R) and is a certified sound healer who will guide you through a ge
 ntle meditation before each sound bath session. Bring your own yoga mat & 
 blanket and come ready to rest and renew! In the OCA Studio.\nSliding scal
 e pricing $25-$35.\nRegister\nA sound bath is a whole-body\, immersive lis
 tening experience. During a sound bath\, participants often sit or lie dow
 n\, and are surrounded by the mostly non-melodic soundscapes created by a 
 range of instruments played by the sound bath facilitator. Hence\, they ar
 e “bathed” in sound.\nSound therapy is a non-invasive healing modality
  that utilizes the physical and physiological interactions of sound on our
  bodies and nervous systems to produce therapeutic results. In a sound hea
 ling session\, specific sonic frequencies are used to soothe the central n
 ervous system\, calm the breath\, and quiet the mind by encouraging the br
 ain to move into more relaxed states\, down from beta (fight-or-flight) an
 d into theta and alpha waves. This increases present-moment awareness and 
 reduces stress and anxiety. Sound baths have been found to be effective in
  improving mood\, cognitive function\, and overall mental\, physical\, and
  spiritual wellbeing.\nCrystal bowl sound baths are particularly powerful 
 in that each bowl is tuned to a specific frequency that corresponds with a
  different chakra\, or energy center\, of the body. Based on specific need
 s\, a practitioner can focus on releasing tension or clearing out stuck en
 ergy in specific chakras by playing certain bowls or intervals.\nWhile att
 ending a sound bath\, you may experience physical sensations brought out b
 y the crystal sound bowls or gong\, such as tingling in your limbs or scal
 p\, slowing of your breathing\, eye flutters\, or small muscle spasms. Not
  to worry! These sensations often indicate the release of tension or emoti
 onal energy stored in the body’s energy systems.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts\, 3850 Doris Murphy Court\, Occide
 ntal\, CA 95465
URL:https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/rest-renew-
 monthly-sound-bath-l5n5c-wchlw-38gmc-rw262-hd6w3-nlnhm-bn8b8-d74pg-d79je-w
 x3an-ampe7-zckp7-gndtj-32c6f-4y8an-wsmxr-y3rtb-8k62p-lx4gx-36kl7-5kgyd-tbe
 tg-2kydp-p4x58
X-SOURCE:Occidental Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Tockify Rileystreet.Art.Com": "https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/581/1796756400000"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tockify_rileystreet.art.com
X-SOURCE:Riley Street Art Supply
UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/581/29945940/0/0
DTSTART:20261208T190000Z
DTEND:20261208T223000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/581/1796756400000
SUMMARY: Abstract Watercolor painting
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Abstract Watercolor Painting at Riley Street\, Sa
 nta Rosa\n\nInstructor: Anne Millett\n\nDate: Tuesday\, December 8th\n\nT
 ime: 11:00AM-2:30PM\n\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nThere will be over 70 high qualit
 y paint colors for you to choose from\, plus 6 metallics. You will spend 
 time selecting your colors intuitively\, for the way they make you feel i
 n the moment. This process is quite personal.\n\nWhat we paint does not n
 eed to accurately represent real things that we see in the "outside world
 ". We listen to our intuitions as our paintings build shape by shape\, ma
 rk by mark\, without planning the end result. We paint simply and methodi
 cally\, focusing on putting paint on paper and seeing what happens\, then
  where we'll go next.\n\nHigh quality watercolor paint\, very good brushe
 s\, 1 piece of Arches 140# cold press watercolor paper (and a second if y
 ou finish your first painting)\, and complete set-ups for painting in cla
 ss will be provided.\n\n\nThis class is designed for adults 18+\n\nAll le
 vels of experience welcome\n\nclass sizes are limited to 8 people\, pleas
 e register early\n\nEmail the instructor\, Anne Millett\, for registratio
 n and payment details: mailto:classes@miraaster.com classes@miraaster.com
  mailto:classes@miraaster.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/658f11d2c4854339cc3385ad/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Join us for Abstract Watercolor Painting at Riley St
 reet\, Santa Rosa Instructor: Anne Millett Date: Tuesday\, December 8th T
 ime: 11:00AM-2:30PM Fee: $45.00...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
