SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nDate: Sunday\, December 20th\nTime: 
 2:00PM-5:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFee: $40.00\n\nThis is a ha
 nds-on make and take class where you will make at least five items includ
 ing a bookmark\, a greeting card\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. The c
 lass will use two different techniques and Jan will explain how to press 
 flowers and which flowers hold their color best. It is a creative experie
 nce!\n\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Jan at: mailto:f
 reshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mailto
 :freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from pressed fl
 owers has been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal art tr
 aining. She utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper\, e
 ach card uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: the d
 ining room table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxes an
 d trays of flowers. She buys card stock by the thousand and picks blooms 
 from her garden and other public places. Her family is used to me saying\
 , “could we stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt is 
 a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on in th
 e East facing parking lot while attending classes. We greatly appreciate 
 it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/641f77b61421bf7aabc6f2d2/scaled_256.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Jan Lochner Date: Sunday\, December 20th
  Time: 2:00PM-5:00PM Location: Santa Rosa Location Fee: $40.00 This is a 
 hands-on make and take class...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
