DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma Valley Community Advisory Commission (SVCAC) was cr
 eated through a Joint Powers Agreement between the County of Sonoma and th
 e City of Sonoma. Its purpose is to provide a public forum to deliberate p
 lanning decisions impacting both the City of Sonoma and the unincorporated
  areas of the Sonoma Valley.
