 or InfoinfoFAQprogram overviewBeginning Tai Chi for Arthritis was created 
 by Dr. Paul Lam\, a retired medical doctor\, with other medical and tai ch
 i experts. It is based on Sun style Tai Chi and consists of gentle movemen
 ts that strengthen muscles\, improve flexibility and decrease pain and sti
 ffness. Practicing this form has been shown to improve balance and decreas
 e falls. Instructors are certified by the Tai Chi for Health Institute 
