 lcome@santarosa.edu)</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma Mo
 untain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 94954</p><p>  Tues\, January 5th | Noon - 2 p.
 m. | Petaluma Campus</p>
